# A separate clone of the team backend repo (AlvinEmenda/Emenda_tech) lives
# here; it has its own .git and must never be committed into this one.
# NOTE: it had been committed as a gitlink before this rule could take effect —
# .gitignore does not apply to paths already in the index — so it was removed
# with `git rm --cached` as well.
# The pattern must NOT be quoted: gitignore treats quotes literally, so the
# previous `"emenda front-end"/` looked for a directory whose name contained
# quote characters and therefore matched nothing. Spaces need no escaping.
emenda front-end/

# Source document library — the 20 originals EMENDA was agreed from (~16 MB).
# Kept out of git on purpose: it carries documents with binding distribution
# markings (a CONFIDENTIAL business plan, a 社内限り competitor analysis that
# forbids naming its partnership candidate externally, and a briefing addressed
# to a named individual). The portal digests them at #/dev/documents; the
# originals stay local.
docs/doc/
